  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2002.03 Replacement of Fuel Burning Devices",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2002.03 Replacement of Fuel Burning Devices. Whenever a fuel burning device installed on or before May 13, 1970 is replaced, the owner or operator shall operate within the limits established in Env-A 2002.02.\n\nSource. #6505-B, eff 5-1-97 (formerly Env-A 1202); ss and moved by #8331, eff 4-23-05 (from Env-A 2003.03); ss by #10416, eff 9-24-13; ss by #13809, eff 11-18-23",
